# Optional operator-only environment for manual deployment.
# Prefer `npx wrangler login` for interactive OAuth authentication.
# For automation, inject a narrowly scoped token from your secret manager.
# Never put deployment credentials in wrangler.jsonc or public bundled data.
# CI and releases do not deploy or consume these credentials.
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
